  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Suppose $|\\,p\\,|=10\\sqrt{2}$ and the angle between vectors $p$ and $q$ is $\\theta ={45}^{\u2218}.$ Find the scalar projection of $p$ onto $q.$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p & =|\\,p\\,|\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({45}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
